title: $:/mf/gen/CLI command/mf repo fold
catalog: CLI command
target: mf repo fold
summary: Fold now what writes to many records left pending

!! Reference

```
Fold now what writes to many records left pending

The daemon folds it by itself after thirty seconds without activity; this does it at once, one list at a time, and prints how many lists it folded (0 when nothing was pending). `mf repo wear` says what is pending.

Usage: mf repo fold

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
```
